<div class="takeaways">
  <p class="takeaways__title">Shingle prices per square at a glance</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A roofing “square” is 100 sq ft of roof surface — usually three bundles of standard shingles.</li>
    <li>Typical 2026 material cost: about $90–$150 per square for 3-tab, $120–$200 for architectural (dimensional), and $200–$450+ for premium or designer shingles.</li>
